{"type":"message","id":"6b18ca88","parentId":"40f557f4","timestamp":"2026-02-02T17:02:09.678Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"image:17","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This drawing (A-704.00) is an **Interior Details** sheet, not a finish schedule. It contains construction details for storefront and door assemblies:\n\n- **C4**: Detail @ Sliding Door ED-1-06 (3\" = 1'-0\")\n- **C2**: Detail @ Exterior Storefront (3\" = 1'-0\")\n- **A4**: Detail @ Exterior Storefront (3\" = 1'-0\")\n- **A2**: Detail @ Interior Storefront (3\" = 1'-0\")\n\nThe details show components including:\n- Exterior thermally broken ballistic resistant glass storefront doors\n- Interior ballistic resistant glass storefront doors\n- HSS posts secured to structure\n- Aluminum enclosures to match storefront\n- HSS clad with aluminum enclosure\n- GYP board attachments\n- Metal stud tight to HSS per partition type\n- Door frames secured to HSS\n\n**There is no finish schedule, room schedule, or material legend on this sheet.** The finish schedule would typically be found on a different sheet (commonly an A-600 series sheet for this project). You would need to provide that specific drawing for the requested extraction."}],"details":{"model":"anthropic/claude-opus-4-5","image":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-bellevue-hospital/drawings/pages/page_024.png","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1770051729657}}
