{"type":"message","id":"f99560ab","parentId":"3f502650","timestamp":"2026-02-02T17:02:51.847Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"image:25","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This drawing is **A-501.00 - Reflected Ceiling Plan and Roof Plan**, not A-701. It does not contain a door schedule or partition type schedule. It shows:\n\n- Reflected ceiling plans (Level 1 enlarged RCP and Emergency Entrance Canopy Roof Plan)\n- Ceiling keynotes for the ED Addition\n- Architectural keynotes for the ED Addition\n- Ceiling symbol legend\n- Ceiling finished legend (C-1: 2x2 ceiling tile non-correctional grade ceiling; C-1a: 2x4 non-correctional grade ceiling)\n- Fixture mounting matrix\n- Reflected ceiling general notes\n\n**No door schedule or partition type information is present on this sheet.** A door schedule would typically appear on a sheet labeled A-701 or similar. You would need to provide the actual A-701 sheet to extract that data."}],"details":{"model":"anthropic/claude-opus-4-5","image":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-bellevue-hospital/drawings/pages/page_021.png","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1770051771841}}
{"type":"message","id":"33867598","parentId":"f99560ab","timestamp":"2026-02-02T17:02:58.635Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"image:26","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This drawing is **A-704.00 (Interior Details)**, not A-801. It contains storefront and sliding door details (Details C4, C2, A4, A2) for the **H+H Bellevue ED Ambulance Bay Addition** project. There is no finish schedule or material legend on this sheet.\n\nYou would need the actual **A-801** sheet to extract finish schedule and material legend data."}],"details":{"model":"anthropic/claude-opus-4-5","image":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-bellevue-hospital/drawings/pages/page_024.png","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1770051778630}}
{"type":"message","id":"f5f66721","parentId":"33867598","timestamp":"2026-02-02T17:03:08.040Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"image:27","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This drawing **AD-101** is actually sheet **A-8.00** — it's an **Interior Finish Plan, Furniture Plan, and Schedules** for the **ED Ambulance Bay Addition** at **H+H Bellevue**, not a demolition drawing.\n\n**There is no demolition scope shown on this sheet.** It contains:\n\n- Interior Finish Plan (detail A8)\n- Interior Furniture Plan (detail A5)\n- Finish Schedule (ceiling, wall, floor materials)\n- Millwork Schedule\n- Finish & Floor Pattern Legend\n- Wall Protection Legend\n- Finish General Notes\n\n**No demo areas, removal items, walls to be removed, or hazardous material/asbestos abatement notes are identified on this drawing.**\n\nThe demolition plans would typically be on a separate sheet (often designated with a \"D\" prefix, e.g., AD-101 or D-series drawings). You may want to look for sheets labeled **\"Demolition Plan\"** or **\"Selective Demolition\"** in the drawing set."}],"details":{"model":"anthropic/claude-opus-4-5","image":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-bellevue-hospital/drawings/pages/page_025.png","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1770051788022}}
