{"type":"message","id":"0c7faffb","parentId":"bbed0cbb","timestamp":"2026-02-02T17:03:27.455Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"image:28","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Drawing Analysis: Sheet A-701.00\n\n## Project Information\n- **Project:** ED AMBULANCE BAY ADDITION\n- **Location:** H+H Bellevue\n- **Architect:** ARRAY ARCHITECTS (462 1st Avenue, New York, NY 10016)\n- **Date:** 09/25/25\n- **Project No.:** 6629\n- **Sheet Title:** PARTITION TYPES, LEGENDS, AND DOOR SCHEDULE\n\n**Yes, this is a Door Schedule sheet.** It also contains partition type information, door legends, and hardware details.\n\n---\n\n## DOOR SCHEDULE - ED ADDITION\n\n| DOOR | ROOM NAME | TYPE | SIZE (W x H) | MATERIAL | FRAME MATERIAL | GLAZING | FRAME FINISH | HARDWARE SET | REMARKS |\n|------|-----------|------|-------------|----------|---------------|---------|-------------|-------------|---------|\n| ED-01 | CART ROOM | - | 3'-0\" x 7'-0\" | A | AL | NA | SAL | - | - |\n| ED-1A | ENTRANCE VESTIBULE | B | 3'-6\" x 7'-0\" | A | AL | NA | SAL | S4 | - |\n| ED-1B | WIRE SECURITYROUP | B | 3'-0\" x 7'-0\" | A | AL | NA | SAL | S5 | BALLISTIC LEVEL 3, DOOR FRAME AND GLAZING |\n| ED-1C | WIRE SECURITYROUP | B | 3'-0\" x 7'-0\" | A | AL | NA | SAL | G1 | - |\n| ED-1E | ENTRANCE VESTIBULE | I | 14'-4\" x 7'-0\" | A | AL | NA | SAL | 12'-2 1/2\" | S3 | BALLISTIC LEVEL 3, DOOR FRAME AND GLAZING |\n| ED-1H | ENTRANCE VESTIBULE | I | 6' x 7'-0\" | A | AL | NA | SAL | 12'-2 1/2\" | S5 | - |\n| ED-"}],"details":{"model":"anthropic/claude-opus-4-5","image":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-bellevue-hospital/drawings/pages/page_022.png","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1770051807449}}
{"type":"message","id":"6d4fbc4a","parentId":"0c7faffb","timestamp":"2026-02-02T17:03:43.400Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"image:29","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Sheet A-00.00 — CASEWORK AND INTERIOR DETAILS\n\n**Project:** ED Ambulance Bay Addition, H+H Bellevue (462 1st Avenue, New York, NY 10016)\n\n**Architect:** ARRAY Architects (200 Madison Avenue, 14th Floor, NYC)\n\n**Issued:** 09/25/25 — ISSUED SOLUTION FOR BID\n\n**Project No.:** 6629 | **Date:** 09/25/25\n\n---\n\n## Yes, this is an interior details sheet. It contains the following details:\n\n### Details Shown:\n\n1. **A0 — Full Height PT/W-1 Panel – Tile Top Detail** (6\" = 1'-0\")\n2. **A7 — PT/W-1 Wall Tile Outside Corner Detail** (3\" = 1'-0\")\n3. **A5 — Section @ Epoxy Floor to Concrete** (3\" = 1'-0\")\n4. **A4 — Stonhard Stonciad Base** (3\" = 1'-0\")\n5. **A3 — Stonhard RT2 Base** (3\" = 1'-0\")\n6. **B3 — Full Height PT/W-1 Panel – Vertical Joint Detail** (3\" = 1'-0\")\n7. **C4 — Section @ Full Height Cabinet** (1 1/2\" = 1'-0\")\n8. **C8 — Security Control Desk Section Detail** (3\" = 1'-0\")\n9. **D3 — Section @ Typical Base Cabinet** (1 1/2\" = 1'-0\")\n10. **E3 — Security Desk Corner Detail** (3\" = 1'-0\")\n\n---\n\n## Key Information Extracted:\n\n### Cabinet Dimensions Legend:\n- **Full Height Cabinets:** Ceiling height 1'-1\" to 2'-1\" (see plans); Toe/Kick/FFT 4\"; Shelves per casework notes; Full height cabinet 7'-2\"\n- **Work Counters:** Back splash 2\"-6\" typical (4\" when adjacent to base cabinets); base cabin"}],"details":{"model":"anthropic/claude-opus-4-5","image":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-bellevue-hospital/drawings/pages/page_023.png","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1770051823392}}
