{"type":"message","id":"5a7464a1","parentId":"d030e025","timestamp":"2026-02-02T17:05:13.036Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"image:41","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Drawing E-101.00 — Electrical Floor and Roof Power Plan\n\n**Project:** H+H Bellevue — ED Ambulance Bay Addition\n**Architect:** ARRAY Architects\n**Drawing:** E-101.00 | Electrical Floor and Roof Power Plan\n\n---\n\n## Panel Legend\n\n| Panel ID | Description |\n|----------|-------------|\n| **LP1** | Panel B-1/LP-DWP+L15, Circuit #1 |\n| **Normal Panel** | N-1, Circuit # |\n| **CDP-1** | Panel FAG-4, Circuit # |\n| **CDP-2** | Panel FAG-B, Circuit # |\n| **EDP-1** | Equipment (Emergency Branch) |\n| **EDP-A** | Panel CDP-P+CDP-A, Circuit # |\n| **ECDP-A** | Panel CDP-P-A, Circuit # |\n\n---\n\n## Outlet & Equipment Locations (Electrical Power Plan - View 1)\n\n**Lower-left area (main ED space):**\n- **USB BBR** — wall-mounted\n- Multiple **duplex receptacles** (CDP-P circuits) along perimeter walls\n- **AQ-1** receptacle location (dedicated circuit)\n- **Fire detector** (EDP-A circuit)\n- **CDP-1, CDP-2** — sub-panel locations within the space\n- **DSP-1, DSP-2, DSP-3** — distribution sub-panels\n- **Nurse station / counter area** with clustered receptacles (CDP-P circuits)\n- **PROPOSE NR 2\"-10\" EMT CONDUIT FROM OUTDOOR PANEL** notation\n- **Data/voice system** outlet\n- Multiple **floor-mounted receptacles** in central zone\n- **Electrical/Emergency cabinet/closet** — center of plan\n- **Refrigerator/Freezer** — dedicated circuits (EDP# series)\n- **Door operator** — dedicated circuit\n- **Low voltage system** location near entry\n- **ACCU-1** — equipment connection (lower right)\n- **Non-standard receptacle (WP)** — weatherproof, exterior\n\n**Ambulance Court area (upper"}],"details":{"model":"anthropic/claude-opus-4-5","image":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-bellevue-hospital/drawings/pages/page_032.png","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1770051913031}}
{"type":"message","id":"22b6a66e","parentId":"5a7464a1","timestamp":"2026-02-02T17:05:28.962Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"image:42","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Electrical Lighting Plan - Drawing E-201.00\n\n## Project: H+H Bellevue ED Ambulance Bay Addition\n**Address:** 462 1st Avenue, New York, NY 10016\n**Architect:** ARRAY Architects\n\n---\n\n## Fixture Types Identified on Plan\n\nThe following fixture type designations appear throughout the plan:\n\n| Fixture Tag | Locations |\n|---|---|\n| **NF1** | Extensively used throughout main areas - appears to be the primary fixture type |\n| **NF11** | Multiple locations across the plan |\n| **DNF1** | Several locations |\n| **DNF1(E)** | Fixtures on emergency circuit |\n| **DNF1(13)** | Specific circuit designation |\n| **DNF12** | Select locations |\n| **DNF13** | Select locations |\n| **LF2** | Lower areas of plan |\n| **LF-D** | Multiple locations in lower zones |\n| **PHOTO(S)** | Photocell sensor locations |\n\n*Note: Refer to architectural drawings for full lighting fixture schedule and controls (per Lighting Note #3).*\n\n---\n\n## Panel Legend / Circuit Branch Types\n\n### Life Safety Branch\n- **LS(P):** Panel S-LCLP-1/MDP-LS2, Circuit #\n- **LS(N):** Normal, Panel N-1, Circuit #\n\n### Critical Branch\n- **CR(T1):** Panel TAC-A, Circuit #\n- **CR(B1):** Panel TAC-B, Circuit #\n\n### Equipment (Emergency) Branch\n- **EQ(P1):** Panel SQ-PP1, Circuit #\n- **EQ(E):** Panel GSHP-A, Circuit #\n\n---\n\n## Emergency Lighting\n\n- Fixtures marked with **(E)** designation (e.g., **DNF1(E)**) are connected to emergency power\n- **Lighting Note #8:** Fixtures indicated with \"EM\" shall be energized via an existing emergency system and connected ahead of main switch to operate **automatically in the event of failure of the normal lighting system**\n\n---\n\n## Exit Signs\n\n- **Exit sign symbols** appear at doorways and"}],"details":{"model":"anthropic/claude-opus-4-5","image":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-bellevue-hospital/drawings/pages/page_034.png","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1770051928956}}
{"type":"message","id":"4b02e9a7","parentId":"22b6a66e","timestamp":"2026-02-02T17:05:43.498Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"image:43","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Drawing E-301.00 — Electrical Riser and Panel Schedules\n\n## Project: H+H Bellevue — ED Ambulance Bay Addition\n\n---\n\n## PANELBOARD SCHEDULE: PANEL CEHDP-A\n\n| Field | Detail |\n|---|---|\n| **Designation** | CEHDP-A (Existing) |\n| **Service Voltage** | 480/277V, 3Φ, 4W |\n| **Main Bus Rating** | 42 spaces, 3000A / 2000A / 4000A |\n| **Main Device** | Existing |\n| **AIC Rating** | Existing |\n| **Main Feeder** | Existing |\n| **Enclosure** | Existing |\n| **Mounting** | Existing |\n\n**Options:** Bonded Ground Bus, Isolated Ground Bus, 200% Neutral Bus, SPD, Power Meter\n\n---\n\n## Circuit Schedule (Odd/Left Side)\n\n| Ckt | Branch Feeder | Load (kVA) | Load Description | Branch Device | Phase |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | Existing | Existing | CEHDN SET-2 | EX, 30 | 1 |\n| 3 | 3-#2 + 1#10G, 3/4\"C | 13,000 | NEW ACU-1 | 3, 20 | 3 |\n| 5 | Existing | Existing | 75 KVA | EX, 100 | 5 |\n| 7 | Existing | Existing | Exhaust Fan West | EX, 39 | 7 |\n| 9 | Existing | Existing | Exhaust Fan East | EX, 20 | 9 |\n| 11 | Existing | Existing | Existing | EX, 200 | 11 |\n| 13 | Existing | Existing | VP-1 | 2, 100 | 13 |\n| 15 | 3-#12 + 1#10G, 3"}],"details":{"model":"anthropic/claude-opus-4-5","image":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-bellevue-hospital/drawings/pages/page_036.png","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1770051943467}}
